  "hints": [
    "For large n the terms behave like n/n³. Compare with that.",
    "Use bₙ = 1/n² in the limit comparison test."
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Compare with $b_n = \\frac{1}{n^2}$: $\\lim \\frac{a_n}{b_n} = \\lim \\frac{n^3 + n^2}{n^3 + 2} = 1$, a positive finite number.",
    "$\\sum \\frac1{n^2}$ converges ($p = 2$), so the series converges."
  ],
